{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-degradation","title":"风控服务故障时的放行策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/performance-ops/risk-degradation","wordCount":3457,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"风控服务故障时的放行策略\">风控服务故障时的放行策略</h1><p>风控服务挂掉的那一刻，系统必须立刻回答一个没有正确答案的问题：是全部放行，还是全部拦截？全部放行意味着风控故障期间的欺诈成本降为零，攻击者如果知道这个规律，会主动制造风控故障；全部拦截意味着风控故障等同于业务停摆，损失可能比全部放行的欺诈损失大得多。真实的答案不是一个二选一，而是一套按交易风险分级的降级策略——而这套策略本身，是整个风控系统里最需要谨慎设计也最容易设计错的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>降级的核心概念是<strong>把&quot;风控不可用&quot;从一个二元状态变成一组分级状态</strong>。二元状态（可用/不可用）迫使系统在两难之间选边；分级状态允许系统在不同故障严重程度下采取不同的姿态，并在故障恢复的过程中逐步收紧。</p>\n<p>第二个概念是<strong>失效姿态的默认值必须是显式决定的</strong>。很多系统的实际行为是由代码结构决定的：如果风控调用没有 catch 异常，那么风控故障会让整笔交易失败——这是一个事实上的 fail-closed，但它不是设计出来的，是偶然形成的。等到线上出事时，团队才发现自己一直在跑一个没人决定过的策略。因此失效姿态必须是被写下来的、被评审的、被测试的。</p>\n<p>第三个概念是<strong>降级期间的决策仍然要留痕</strong>。降级时放行的交易不是&quot;没有决策&quot;，而是&quot;一个特殊的决策&quot;。它必须被标记（降级放行、降级级别、降级原因、降级时间窗口），因为这些交易是事后复核的重点对象——攻击者如果知道降级窗口，会集中在这个窗口作案。留痕让事后可以精确地捞出这批交易做二次判定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[风控服务] --&gt; B{健康检查}&#10;  B --&gt;|正常| C[L0 完整决策]&#10;  B --&gt;|部分依赖超时| D[L1 特征降级&lt;br/&gt;缺省部分特征]&#10;  B --&gt;|主服务不可用| E[L2 本地规则模式&lt;br/&gt;规则副本+本地名单]&#10;  B --&gt;|规则副本也不可用| F[L3 分级放行&lt;br/&gt;按金额/场景]&#10;  B --&gt;|全线故障| G[L4 全量放行&lt;br/&gt;强事后复核]&#10;  C --&gt; H[正常流量]&#10;  D --&gt; I[标记 degraded, 事后抽样复核]&#10;  E --&gt; J[标记 local_rule, 事后复核]&#10;  F --&gt; K[小额放行/大额拦截&lt;br/&gt;标记 degraded_block]&#10;  G --&gt; L[全放行&lt;br/&gt;告警+限流+事后全量复核]\">graph TD\n  A[风控服务] --&gt; B{健康检查}\n  B --&gt;|正常| C[L0 完整决策]\n  B --&gt;|部分依赖超时| D[L1 特征降级&lt;br/&gt;缺省部分特征]\n  B --&gt;|主服务不可用| E[L2 本地规则模式&lt;br/&gt;规则副本+本地名单]\n  B --&gt;|规则副本也不可用| F[L3 分级放行&lt;br/&gt;按金额/场景]\n  B --&gt;|全线故障| G[L4 全量放行&lt;br/&gt;强事后复核]\n  C --&gt; H[正常流量]\n  D --&gt; I[标记 degraded, 事后抽样复核]\n  E --&gt; J[标记 local_rule, 事后复核]\n  F --&gt; K[小额放行/大额拦截&lt;br/&gt;标记 degraded_block]\n  G --&gt; L[全放行&lt;br/&gt;告警+限流+事后全量复核]</pre><h2 id=\"分级降级的设计\">分级降级的设计</h2><p>分级的关键是找到<strong>退化路径上仍能保住的能力</strong>。风控挂掉不等于所有能力都消失——规则集可以预先同步到实例本地，名单可以有本地副本，模型可以有一个轻量版本。把这些能力组织成退化序列，就能让降级不是崖式的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>仍可用的能力</th>\n<th>决策姿态</th>\n<th>事后动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0</td>\n<td>全部依赖正常</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>完整决策</td>\n<td>常规抽样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>部分特征超时</td>\n<td>规则 + 模型（特征缺省）</td>\n<td>特征缺省决策</td>\n<td>标记 + 抽样复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>特征服务不可用</td>\n<td>本地规则副本 + 本地名单</td>\n<td>规则单独决策</td>\n<td>标记 + 重点复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>风控主服务不可用</td>\n<td>网关侧静态策略</td>\n<td>按金额/场景分级</td>\n<td>全量标记 + 复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>全线不可用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全量放行</td>\n<td>全量复核 + 告警升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>L1 是常态而非异常。</strong> 在生产环境里，偶尔有特征读取超时是正常现象，系统应当平滑地降级到&quot;用缺省特征做决策&quot;而不是让这些请求失败。这一级别不需要人工介入，只要比例维持在低位即可。</p>\n<p><strong>L2 的本地规则副本</strong>是降级设计中最有价值的一项投入。它把规则集中最关键的几十条（法定名单、明确的攻击模式、额度硬上限）同步到每个实例的本地存储，并定期全量刷新。当所有远程依赖不可用时，实例仍然能对这些硬约束做判断——保住了风控最不可放弃的部分。副本的选择标准是&quot;命中即确定&quot;且&quot;不依赖实时特征&quot;：名单类、额度类、场景硬约束类符合条件，而频次类、画像类不符合。</p>\n<p><strong>L3 的分级放行</strong>是真正需要业务方参与决策的一层。核心问题是&quot;哪些交易可以承受无风控放行&quot;。通常的判断维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>金额</strong>：小额交易的欺诈损失有限，放行的代价低；大额交易应当保持拦截倾向。</li>\n<li><strong>场景</strong>：虚拟商品（充值、卡券）不可追回，应当更保守；实物商品发货前可拦截，可以更宽松。</li>\n<li><strong>渠道</strong>：渠道自身的风控能力是外部保障，有渠道风控兜底的交易可以放行。</li>\n<li><strong>用户等级</strong>：高等级老客的历史行为可信，放行风险低；新客与匿名交易应当保守。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这四个维度组合成一个静态的分级表，写入网关或风控客户端的本地配置。这张表在风控正常时也需要维护，因为它是 L3 触发时的唯一依据——等到故障发生时才想着定策略，已经来不及了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效姿态-fail-open-与-fail-closed-的量化\">失效姿态：fail-open 与 fail-closed 的量化</h2><p>选择放行还是拦截，可以量化。设风控故障期间的交易量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，欺诈率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，平均单笔欺诈损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，平均单笔正常交易的贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{profit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<p><strong>fail-open（全放行）</strong> 的期望损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot p \\cdot C_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——所有欺诈成功，正常交易全部完成。</p>\n<p><strong>fail-closed（全拦截）</strong> 的期望损失是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot (1-p) \\cdot C_{\\text{profit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——所有正常交易被拒，欺诈也没发生。</p>\n<p>两者相等时的临界欺诈率是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* = \\frac{C_{\\text{profit}}}{C_{\\text{fraud}} + C_{\\text{profit}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子的读法是：<strong>只有当故障期间的欺诈率超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>profit</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>profit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{profit}} / (C\\_{\\text{fraud}} + C\\_{\\text{profit}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profit</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fraud</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profit</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时，fail-closed 才比 fail-open 划算。</strong> 一笔正常交易的利润率通常在几个百分点，而一笔欺诈损失的是全额本金。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{profit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是交易额的 3%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是交易额的 100%（全额损失），则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* \\approx 2.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.9%</span></span></span></span></span>。日常欺诈率远低于这个数（通常 0.01%–0.5%），所以<strong>在常规欺诈水平下，fail-open 是更划算的选择</strong>——这解释了为什么绝大多数系统默认放行。</p>\n<p>但这个结论有三个必须加上去的修正：</p>\n<p><strong>修正一：故障是可被利用的信号。</strong> 常态欺诈率低是因为有风控在拦，不是因为攻击者不存在。如果攻击者能观测到降级窗口（通过试探交易是否被拦），他们会在窗口内集中攻击，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 会飙升到远超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的水平。因此降级窗口必须尽量短，且<strong>降级状态不能对外暴露</strong>——被降级放行的交易不应返回任何与正常放行不同的响应（比如不返回风控理由码），否则成为攻击者的信号源。这条常常被忽略：调试用的降级标记如果出现在了响应里，就是把攻击窗口公开了。</p>\n<p><strong>修正二：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 在降级期间不是常数。</strong> 如果风控故障是由一次攻击引发的（攻击者先用流量打垮风控再下手），那么故障期间的实际欺诈率必然远高于常态。这种情形下的正确处理是 fail-closed 或强降级，而不是按常态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 计算出的 fail-open。</p>\n<p><strong>修正三：损失分布不均。</strong> 期望损失相等不代表两种选择等价——fail-closed 的损失是分散的（大量用户各损失一点便利），fail-open 的损失是集中的（少数欺诈个案的大额损失）。合规与舆情上，集中损失的后果往往更严重（一次大额盗刷曝光 vs 一次全量交易失败）。</p>\n<p>因此实践的结论是：<strong>默认 fail-open，但对高风险子集 fail-closed。</strong> 这个&quot;高风险子集&quot;就是 L3 分级表要刻画的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降级期间的运维纪律\">降级期间的运维纪律</h2><p>降级是一次高风险的运营状态，需要配套的纪律，否则会造成比故障本身更大的损失。</p>\n<p><strong>告警必须立刻升级到人工。</strong> 降级自动发生，但降级状态的解除不应全自动。原因是降级解除的时机判断依赖于&quot;故障是否真的恢复&quot;这个判断，而这个判断在故障场景下容易被误判（依赖服务恢复了一半、返回的是缓存数据）。人工确认故障确实消失后再逐级恢复，避免&quot;降级—恢复—再降级&quot;的振荡。</p>\n<p><strong>降级期间加强流量限制。</strong> 风控不可用时，下游往往也要承受更大的真实流量（因为拦截不再消耗交易）。对高风险场景主动限流能减少损失——这是一个反常规的动作（正常时风控是拦截，降级时限流是开源节流的替代），但效果显著。过载保护的标准做法是配合使用客户端侧的自我调节：SRE 描述了一种自适应限流（adaptive throttling），客户端根据最近请求数与后端接受数比例自动限制发出的流量，超出上限的请求&quot;在本地失败、根本不发到网络&quot;（来源：Google SRE Book, <em>Handling Overload</em>, <a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/）。\">https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>标记全量降级交易并保留可追索的能力。</strong> 降级期间放行的交易必须全部标记，且要保留事后干预的能力：如果这些交易中发现了欺诈，系统要能通过 <a href=\"../risk-decision/sync-block-async-review\">同步拦截、人工审核与异步复核</a> 描述的异步复核通道冻结未清算的资金、撤销会话、冻结提现。降级放行不等于放弃干预，只是把干预推迟了。</p>\n<p><strong>降级窗口必须有截止时间。</strong> 无限期的降级是另一种形式的故障。需要设置一个硬截止（比如 30 分钟），到点后系统必须做出选择：要么恢复（在确认故障消失后），要么升级到更保守的姿态（fail-closed）并升级告警。这个机制防止了&quot;降级状态被遗忘&quot;这类慢性事故——它们往往比急性故障造成更大的累计损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"演练-降级必须被测试\">演练：降级必须被测试</h2><p>没有经过演练的降级逻辑，在真正需要它的时候几乎一定不工作。原因是降级路径平时不被执行，代码缺乏测试覆盖，依赖的本地副本可能早已失效，配置可能已经漂移。</p>\n<p>降级的另一根支柱是让&quot;调用一个不可用的下游&quot;这件事本身变得安全——这就是断路器（circuit breaker）模式：把一个受保护的调用包在断路器对象里监视失败，失败累计到阈值后&quot;断路器跳闸，之后所有调用直接返回错误，根本不发起受保护的调用&quot;，从而避免资源耗尽与跨系统的级联故障；它有三个状态——闭合（正常调用）、断开（直接报错）、半开（放行一次试探调用），半开成功则闭合、失败则重新断开（来源：Martin Fowler, <em>CircuitBreaker</em>, <a href=\"https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CircuitBreaker.html）。\">https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CircuitBreaker.html）。</a></p>\n<p>演练清单应当至少覆盖这几项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>演练项</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单依赖超时</td>\n<td>缺省值填充是否生效，总耗时是否仍在预算内</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征服务全不可用</td>\n<td>L2 是否降级为本地规则，本地副本是否为最新</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风控主服务不可用</td>\n<td>L3 分级表是否正确生效，网关配置是否同步</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级标记与复核</td>\n<td>降级交易是否被标记并进入复核队列</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级窗口截止</td>\n<td>硬截止是否触发，恢复流程是否正确</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地副本陈旧</td>\n<td>长时间未刷新时是否有告警</td>\n<td>每半年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;本地副本陈旧&quot;是最容易出问题的一项。本地规则副本定期刷新是一个后台任务，如果它静默失败了几个月，没人会注意到——直到真正需要降级时才发现用的是几个月前的规则。因此副本的<strong>新鲜度必须被监控</strong>，副本年龄超过阈值要告警，即使系统当前完全健康。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>降级应分级（L0 完整 → L1 特征缺省 → L2 本地规则 → L3 分级放行 → L4 全量放行），而非二元的可用/不可用。</li>\n<li>L1（特征超时用缺省值）是生产常态，不需人工介入；L2 的本地规则副本（名单类、额度类硬约束）是降级设计中最有价值的一项投资。</li>\n<li>L3 分级放行按金额、场景、渠道、用户等级组合成静态表，且这张表要在风控正常时就维护好。</li>\n<li>fail-open 与 fail-closed 的临界欺诈率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>profit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* = C_{\\text{profit}}/(C_{\\text{fraud}}+C_{\\text{profit}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">profit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，常规欺诈率下 fail-open 更划算，实践结论是&quot;默认放行、高风险子集拦截&quot;。</li>\n<li>三个修正不可忽略：故障是可被利用的信号（降级状态不得在响应中暴露）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 在降级期不是常数（攻击引发的故障应更保守）、集中损失在合规与舆情上后果更重。</li>\n<li>降级期间运维纪律：告警升级到人工、加强高风险场景限流、全量标记并保留异步追索能力、设置硬截止时间防止降级被遗忘。</li>\n<li>降级逻辑必须演练，重点验证本地副本新鲜度、分级表有效性、标记与复核链路；副本年龄必须被监控。</li>\n<li>延迟预算耗尽与降级触发是同一件事的两端，见 <a href=\"risk-latency-budget\">风控决策延迟预算</a>；降级放行的交易如何回流成样本，见 <a href=\"case-feedback-loop\">案件回流、样本标注与模型迭代</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风控服务故障时的放行策略","id":"风控服务故障时的放行策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分级降级的设计","id":"分级降级的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"失效姿态：fail-open 与 fail-closed 的量化","id":"失效姿态-fail-open-与-fail-closed-的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"降级期间的运维纪律","id":"降级期间的运维纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"演练：降级必须被测试","id":"演练-降级必须被测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"风控决策延迟预算（<交易超时）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/performance-ops/risk-latency-budget"},"next":{"title":"案件回流、样本标注与模型迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/performance-ops/case-feedback-loop"}}